      "writtenOn": "2024-06-05T00:09:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As discussed offline, we will keep the ability to get module own output files here. The reason is that there are several module types both set and get outputFiles within `GenerateBuildActions`, but providers don\u0027t support both \"set\" and \"get\" inside `GenerateBuildActions`.",
      "parentUuid": "0cbb3f42_57bbab4b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2501,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 2507,
        "endChar": 2
      },
